tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:696:        Scenario: own-target validation_ic favors h1, but final_objective_validation_ic
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:697:        favors h5. The blend output must favor h5 because weights align to final objective.
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:699:        engine = _make_engine(multi_horizon_blend=True, blend_weight_method="validation_ic")
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:705:        # After P10 Role21 fix: validation_ic key now contains final_objective_validation_ic
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:706:        # Own-target metrics are stored separately for diagnostics
