tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:732:        weight_h5 = 0.85 / (0.15 + 0.85)
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:733:        expected_blend = sig1 * (1 - weight_h5) + sig5 * weight_h5
