tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:738:            "Blend must use final-objective validation_ic (favoring h5), not own-target validation_ic"
tests/phase35/test_p10_multi_horizon_blend.py:746:            "Blend should be closer to sig5 (high final-objective IC) than sig1"
